

Sagantaa qulqulleessi-memoorii.


>> Veggy := Wanta haaraa.
Veggy irratti: ['haaraa'] godhi: {
	>> v := ofii haaraa.
	v init. <- v.
}.

Veggy irratti: ['init'] godhi: { koo veggies := 0. }.

Veggy irratti: ['carrots:'] godhi: { :a koo veggies := a. <- Homaa. }.
Veggy irratti: ['carrots'] godhi: { <- koo veggies. }.
Veggy irratti: ['+'] godhi: { :f
	>> n := Veggy haaraa.
	n carrots: (f carrots + koo veggies). <- n.
}.

Veggy irratti: ['gara-barreeffamaatti'] godhi: { <- koo veggies gara-barreeffamaatti.
}.

Lakkoofsa irratti: ['carrots'] godhi: {
	>> x := Veggy haaraa.
	x carrots: ofii. <- x.
}.

Lakkoofsa irratti: ['add:and:'] godhi: { :a :b <- (a + b).
}.

>> q := 0 add: (3 carrots + 2 carrots) and: 4 carrots.
Baʼii barreessi: q, dhaabi.
